   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Windowed Bounding Box Extraction (<64MB RAM)\n",
    "A 100x100 pixel window (500m x 500m physical span) centered on the Shackleton crater rim crest was extracted using `rasterio.windows.Window`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
