      "Fidelity: NASA_DERIVED\n",
      "Source: NASA GSFC PGDA Product 78 (Site04 LOLA 5m/px)\n",
      "Elevation Range: 605.5 m to 937.5 m (Reference Mean: 770.4 m)\n",
